    ratify and confirm, by way of special resolution, the approval by shareholders on November 16, 2023 authorising, upon receipt of the
    approval of Proposals No. 3 and No. 4, and at an Effective Time and RS Ratio that the Board of Directors determines are in the best
    interest of the Company (including in the interest of maintaining the Ordinary Share&rsquo;s listing on Nasdaq), a newly amended
